# migrated from tests/cases/prosepage.chat (gen346). Rifatto al gen505y sul
# passaggio INLINE, come chiede il commit gen436 («di Wikipedia non si conserva
# niente»): le pagine curate in kb/learning/pages/ non esistono piu' per
# decisione di F., e «si legge un testo, non si apre un archivio». La KB e'
# quella intera (R1) e le entita' sono inventate, perche' Parigi la KB la
# conosce gia' (R2).
[mock live]
!set PARROT0_BASE=kb/core/base.p0
!set PARROT0_SESSION=
!set PARROT0_WORLD_FACTS=1
!set PARROT0_PROFILE=kb/profiles/agi.p0
!set PARROT0_LANG=en
!timeout 6
!reset

[test prosepage]
# deep-reasoning M2 (docs/plans/deep-reasoning.md §8): the PROSE extractor. A
# read runs each sentence through the SAME comprehension parser M0 extended
# (extract_class_statement, in extract-only mode so the simple "X is a Y" is
# asserted too), and every fact carries its source fragment (M1).

> read: zorbia is the capital of nivora. zorbia is located in nivora.
< Learned 2 fact(s), skipped 0.
!query located_in(zorbia, nivora)
# each extracted fact remembers the exact sentence it came from (M1 provenance).
> where did you learn about zorbia?
<~ located_in(zorbia, nivora) from: "zorbia is located in nivora"

> read: a glimp is a mammal. a glimp is an aquatic animal.
< Learned 2 fact(s), skipped 0.
# an extracted membership is real, queryable knowledge.
> is a glimp a mammal?
< Yes.

# honest: a topic with no page yields no facts, never invented.
> read the page on Xyzzy
< I don't have a page with extractable facts on xyzzy.
!forget capital_of(zorbia, nivora)
!forget located_in(zorbia, nivora)
!forget mammal(glimp)
!forget aquatic_animal(glimp)
